    "huusk_background_cards_cmatER": {
      "type": "huusk-background-cards",
      "blocks": {
        "card_xh9aTE": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "heading_inset": 26,
            "heading_inset_mobile": 16,
            "caption_inset": 26,
            "caption_inset_mobile": 16,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/HIGH-CARBON_EDGE_BUILT_TO_LAST_3.webp",
            "image_mobile": "shopify://shop_images/HIGH-CARBON_EDGE_BUILT_TO_LAST_4.webp",
            "heading": "HIGH-CARBON EDGE \nBUILT TO LAST",
            "heading_weight": "600",
            "caption_position_mobile": "bottom-left",
            "caption_position": "top-right",
            "heading_font": "var(--font-heading--family)",
            "heading_size": 36,
            "heading_size_mobile": 18,
            "heading_position": "top-left",
            "heading_offset_y": -4,
            "heading_offset_y_mobile": 0,
            "heading_color": "#d4d0c9",
            "caption": "<p><em>Made from high-carbon steel, the blade is ground to a sharp&nbsp;plain edge&nbsp;that slices cleanly through meat, vegetables and&nbsp;fish without tearing.&nbsp;The forged steel construction keeps the edge&nbsp;resilient and durable,&nbsp;ready for repeated kitchen and BBQ use.</em></p>",
            "caption_font": "var(--font-body--family)",
            "caption_size": 12,
            "caption_size_mobile": 10,
            "caption_color": "#b9b5ad"
          }
        },
        "card_hAMhf4": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "heading_inset": 26,
            "heading_inset_mobile": 16,
            "caption_inset": 26,
            "caption_inset_mobile": 16,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/THE_REINFORCED_FINGER_HOLE_GRIP.webp",
            "image_mobile": "shopify://shop_images/THE_REINFORCED_FINGER_HOLE_GRIP_2.webp",
            "heading": "THE REINFORCED \nFINGER HOLE GRIP",
            "heading_weight": "600",
            "caption_position_mobile": "bottom-left",
            "caption_position": "top-right",
            "heading_font": "var(--font-heading--family)",
            "heading_size": 36,
            "heading_size_mobile": 18,
            "heading_position": "top-left",
            "heading_offset_y": -4,
            "heading_offset_y_mobile": 0,
            "heading_color": "#d4d0c9",
            "caption": "<p><em>A circular finger hole near the handle sits where your thumb rests,&nbsp;giving you a steadier, more controlled hold during forceful cuts.&nbsp;It also provides a convenient point for hanging the knife safely&nbsp;on a hook or block between uses.</em></p>",
            "caption_font": "var(--font-body--family)",
            "caption_size": 12,
            "caption_size_mobile": 10,
            "caption_color": "#b9b5ad"
          }
        },
        "card_xLyYi9": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "heading_inset": 26,
            "heading_inset_mobile": 16,
            "caption_inset": 26,
            "caption_inset_mobile": 16,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/ONE_MATCHED_SET_FOR_EVERY_KITCHEN_TASK.webp",
            "image_mobile": "shopify://shop_images/ONE_MATCHED_SET_FOR_EVERY_KITCHEN_TASK_2.webp",
            "heading": "ONE MATCHED SET FOR \nEVERY KITCHEN TASK",
            "heading_weight": "600",
            "caption_position_mobile": "bottom-left",
            "caption_position": "top-right",
            "heading_font": "var(--font-heading--family)",
            "heading_size": 36,
            "heading_size_mobile": 18,
            "heading_position": "top-left",
            "heading_offset_y": -4,
            "heading_offset_y_mobile": 0,
            "heading_color": "#d4d0c9",
            "caption": "<p><em>Rather than reaching for a different tool for every cut, the set groups&nbsp;heavier chopping, delicate slicing and fine trimming into three matched&nbsp;blades. Each knife is tailored to a separate task, so the kit behaves like&nbsp;an all-round cooking team at your counter — from the first trim to the final slice.</em></p>",
            "caption_font": "var(--font-body--family)",
            "caption_size": 12,
            "caption_size_mobile": 10,
            "caption_color": "#b9b5ad"
          }
        },
        "card_Nxm4eV": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "heading_inset": 36,
            "heading_inset_mobile": 16,
            "caption_inset": 36,
            "caption_inset_mobile": 16,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/FORGED_BY_HAND_THE_JAPANESE_WAY.webp",
            "image_mobile": "shopify://shop_images/FORGED_BY_HAND_THE_JAPANESE_WAY_2.webp",
            "heading": "FORGED BY HAND, \nTHE JAPANESE WAY",
            "heading_weight": "600",
            "caption_position_mobile": "bottom-left",
            "caption_position": "top-right",
            "heading_font": "var(--font-heading--family)",
            "heading_size": 36,
            "heading_size_mobile": 18,
            "heading_position": "top-left",
            "heading_offset_y": -4,
            "heading_offset_y_mobile": 0,
            "heading_color": "#d4d0c9",
            "caption": "<p><em>Forged by hand rather than mass production, each blade&nbsp;follows a traditional&nbsp;forging process that shapes the steel and leaves&nbsp;its distinctive hammered texture.&nbsp;The hand-forged build adds rust&nbsp;and corrosion resistance, helping the&nbsp;blade hold up to daily&nbsp;prep and outdoor use over a longer working life</em></p>",
            "caption_font": "var(--font-body--family)",
            "caption_size": 12,
            "caption_size_mobile": 10,
            "caption_color": "#b9b5ad"
          }
        },
        "card_wTNcKF": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "heading_inset": 26,
            "heading_inset_mobile": 16,
            "caption_inset": 26,
            "caption_inset_mobile": 16,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/ROSEWOOD_GRIP_WITH_A_FULL-TANG_CORE.webp",
            "image_mobile": "shopify://shop_images/ROSEWOOD_GRIP_WITH_A_FULL-TANG_CORE_2.webp",
            "heading": "ROSEWOOD GRIP \nWITH A FULL-TANG \nCORE",
            "heading_weight": "600",
            "caption_position_mobile": "bottom-left",
            "caption_position": "top-right",
            "heading_font": "var(--font-heading--family)",
            "heading_size": 36,
            "heading_size_mobile": 18,
            "heading_position": "top-left",
            "heading_offset_y": -4,
            "heading_offset_y_mobile": 0,
            "heading_color": "#d4d0c9",
            "caption": "<p><em>The steel blade runs fully through the handle in a full-tang build, pairing structural&nbsp;stability with a balanced, unbreakable grip. The grip itself is finished in&nbsp;natural rosewood; its unique grain and warm luster give every knife a one-of-a-kind&nbsp;character. Natural wood may carry slight grain and color differences.</em></p>",
            "caption_font": "var(--font-body--family)",
            "caption_size": 12,
            "caption_size_mobile": 10,
            "caption_color": "#b9b5ad"
          }
        },
        "card_jPtgnY": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "heading_inset": 26,
            "heading_inset_mobile": 16,
            "caption_inset": 26,
            "caption_inset_mobile": 16,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/FROM_HOME_KITCHEN_TO_OUTDOOR_GRILL_READY_TO_GIFT.webp",
            "image_mobile": "shopify://shop_images/FROM_HOME_KITCHEN_TO_OUTDOOR_GRILL_READY_TO_GIFT_2.webp",
            "heading": "FROM HOME KITCHEN \nTO OUTDOOR GRILL, \nREADY TO GIFT",
            "heading_weight": "600",
            "caption_position_mobile": "bottom-left",
            "caption_position": "top-right",
            "heading_font": "var(--font-heading--family)",
            "heading_size": 36,
            "heading_size_mobile": 18,
            "heading_position": "top-left",
            "heading_offset_y": -4,
            "heading_offset_y_mobile": 0,
            "heading_color": "#d4d0c9",
            "caption": "<p><em>Designed for both home-kitchen prep and outdoor BBQs,&nbsp;the set pairs practical&nbsp;cutting power with an elegant, gift-worthy finish.&nbsp;Blending beauty and function,&nbsp;it is a thoughtful present for a friend,&nbsp;family member, or any cook who takes&nbsp;their time in the kitchen.</em></p>",
            "caption_font": "var(--font-body--family)",
            "caption_size": 12,
            "caption_size_mobile": 10,
            "caption_color": "#b9b5ad"
          }
        }
      },
