    "huusk_lean_faq_PXfkyY": {
      "type": "huusk-lean-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_RM6WWw": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What makes HUUSK knives different from ordinary kitchen knives?",
            "answer": "<p>HUUSK puts clear task roles and a modern Japanese-inspired design direction at the center of its knives. The current Huusk Three-Piece Set separates heavier prep, meat slicing, and everyday trimming into three tools, so you can choose by task instead of guessing from appearance. Exact specifications vary by model; check the product page for details.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "faq_bjfdwD": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is included in the Huusk Three-Piece Set?",
            "answer": "<p>The current set includes three knives: Serbian Knife, Cleaver, and Utility. The Serbian chef knife is for heavier prep, Cleaver is for cutting cooked meats, and Utility is for trimming, peeling, and quick prep. Refer to the product listing for exact included items and specifications.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "faq_NNi6c3": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are HUUSK knives suitable for home cooking and BBQ?",
            "answer": "<p>The Huusk Three-Piece Set is intended to support home-kitchen prep and meat or BBQ preparation. Use the Cleaver for heavier prep, Slicing for meat, and Utility for smaller trimming tasks. Choose the knife that fits the food and cut, and use a stable board with safe handling. Check the product page for model-specific guidance.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "faq_jaYMTz": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is a HUUSK knife set a good gift for someone who enjoys cooking?",
            "answer": "<p>It can be a thoughtful, practical gift for a home cook or BBQ enthusiast. The Huusk Three-Piece Set covers different kitchen tasks: heavier prep, meat slicing, and everyday trimming. Check the current product listing for exact included items and packaging details before ordering.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "faq_igWe8U": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How should I care for a high-carbon steel HUUSK knife?",
            "answer": "<p>High-carbon steel needs prompt, careful care to help limit rust. Hand-wash with mild soap, rinse, and dry immediately after use; do not soak it or put it in a dishwasher. Wipe it dry during use and store it in a dry, secure place. Clean it promptly after acidic foods and follow the care instructions for your specific model.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
